{"Background jobs set I18n.locale but never call I18n.fallbacks.ensure_loaded!, so fallback locales (e.g., :en) are not pre-loaded in job context. Since the PR removes config.i18n.fallbacks = true (the previous automatic mechanism), background jobs that call I18n.t may get missing-translation strings when the primary locale file lacks a key that exists in a fallback locale.": 0.8226525187492371}